' file, You can obtain one at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

skinparam shadowing false

title Processing of one frame by the liveness session

start
:frame received from the device stream;
if (an analysis is running, or the last analysed\nframe is less than frame.sampling_ms old?) then (yes)
  :skip the frame;
  stop
endif
:decode the JPEG image;
if (decoding failed?) then (yes)
  :INVALID_FRAME, recorded for diagnostics only;
  stop
endif
:detect faces with YuNet;
if (no face?) then (yes)
  :guidance NO_FACE;
  note right: in the active check, a face missing\nfor too long ends the attempt\n(FACE_CONTINUITY_LOST)
  stop
elseif (more than one face?) then (yes)
  if (active check?) then (yes)
    :FAILED, FACE_CONTINUITY_LOST;
  else (no)
    :guidance MULTIPLE_FACES;
  endif
  stop
endif
if (box consistent with the tracked face?) then (no)
  if (active check?) then (yes)
    :FAILED, FACE_CONTINUITY_LOST;
    stop
  else (no)
    :start a new track,\nclear the score window;
  endif
endif
:quality checks: size, position,\nlighting, sharpness, yaw;
note right: the yaw limit does not apply\nin the active check
if (quality insufficient?) then (yes)
  :guidance LOW_QUALITY, with a tip;
  stop
endif
if (face frontal enough for the classifier?) then (yes)
  :frame score: mean real-class probability\nof the two MiniFASNet models on the square box;
endif
if (active check?) then (yes)
  :landmarks with Face Mesh V2,\neye, mouth and yaw measures;
endif
:update the session state;
:return state, feedback code and progress;
stop
@enduml
